  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Change Programme  - Low Emission, Climate Resilient Planning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity aims to support Pacific Island countries to develop climate change related strategies, policies, and planning frameworks which are necessary to anticipate, plan, and counter some of the impacts of climate change, and transition their economies to a low-carbon future. It is essential for governments to develop climate response plans in order to meet their UNFCCC Paris Agreement commitments, prioritise investments, and leverage climate financing from multilateral and other donors.</narrative>
  </description>
